	(text "U4 TCA9535PWR: A2 / A1 / A0 = GND → I²C1 0x20 (no clash with\nthe INA226s at 0x40-0x45). P00-P03 = relay 1-4 coil feedback\n(10k / 15k + 10 nF dividers, 3.0 V = coil off; inputs 5.5 V-tolerant).\nINT not connected: PA0 drives the winch, so poll the expander.\nP04-P17 spare (12 inputs for later): no internal pull-ups, so set\nthem as outputs, LOW, at start-up. Read input port 0 (reg 0x00)\n≥ 30 ms after switching a relay (CIF §7b)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 226.06 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "6d495a87-7ba8-5f24-b435-09329763d4e8")
	)
